OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather showery morning to
OL,6,Fcome, with a few heavy and possible
OL,7,Fthundery showers. Showers easing this
OL,8,Fafternoon allowing more in the way of
OL,9,Fbrightness to develop. Temperatures
OL,10,Fnear average.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAny lingering showers
OL,13,Fbecoming increasingly restricted to
OL,14,Fwestern coasts this evening, leaving a
OL,15,Fdry night with clearing skies for
OL,16,Fmany. A mild night to come with a few
OL,17,Fmist patches.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
