OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FTuesday will start bright for
OL,6,Fmany, before cloud and scattered
OL,7,Fshowers spread east from the far west.
OL,8,FEastern areas should stay driest, with
OL,9,Fthe best of the brightness.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,12,Fbright morning Wednesday, before a
OL,13,Fband of rain arrives later. Further
OL,14,Frain at times on Thursday, before
OL,15,Fturning drier and brighter Friday.
OL,16,FTemperatures near or a little above
OL,17,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
